    "html": "<p>A rigid vessel of volume <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span> contains <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N\"></span> molecules of an ideal monatomic gas. The average kinetic energy of the molecules is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{k}\"></span>. What is the pressure in the vessel?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2N}{3VE_{k}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2NE_{k}}{3V}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3N}{2VE_{k}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3NE_{k}}{2V}\"></span></li></ol>"
